&lt;h1 id="credential-provider-protocol"&gt;凭证提供者协议&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;原文链接: &lt;a href="https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/reference/credential-provider-protocol.html"&gt;https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/reference/credential-provider-protocol.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
